# CLAUDE.md is committed in this repo, overriding the global ignore: it is the one-line import of
# AGENTS.md, the project conventions, which Claude Code would otherwise never load. Personal,
# uncommitted instructions go in CLAUDE.local.md instead.
!CLAUDE.md
# Screenshots taken as acceptance evidence during a run — reproducible from the suite, not sources
e2e-out/
# Per-machine environment files hold local credentials and are never committed
.env*.local
# Astro's generated types for the landing page (site/), rewritten on every build or check. Kept here
# rather than in site/.gitignore, because the lint reads this file only
.astro/
